  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Given its design and excessive size, the proposed scheme would result in an obtrusive development which would fail to remain subservient to the main house, and cause harm to its character and visual appearance, the existing streetscene and surrounding area. This would be contrary to policies CC1 (Context and Character), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) of the adopted Local Plan (2015) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed single storey rear extension and two storey side extension, on account of its siting, excessive size and design, would result in harm to the living conditions of its neighbours at Nos. 229 and 233 Uxbridge Road by overshadowing and an increased sense of enclosure. This would be contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD"
  ],
